# The controls pages from the option menu (fixtures/controls: options'
# lba.cfg with GamePad: ON). On the keys' page Talk/Search takes K, Up
# is refused as bound already, Talk/Search's second binding is
# cleared, Page Down and Page Up move, Zoom On/Off's second binding
# takes Delete, which it keeps, where the Classic's page cleared it at
# once, and End and Accept Configuration write the bindings into
# lba.cfg. On the pad's page Menus' first binding is refused, Escape
# goes to Accept Configuration and Escape again leaves with the
# bindings as they were. The pages keep their line and their column
# from one to the next.

hold 0.05
sleep 40
shot menu
key Down Down Return
sleep 3
shot options
key Down Down Down Down Down Return
sleep 3
shot controls
key Down Return
sleep 3
shot keys
key Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down
sleep 1
key Return
sleep 2
shot capture
key k
sleep 2
shot bound
key Return
sleep 2
key Up
sleep 2
shot refused
key Right Delete
sleep 1
shot cleared
key Next
sleep 1
shot next
key Prior
sleep 1
key Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down
sleep 1
key Return
sleep 2
key Delete
sleep 2
shot delete
key End
sleep 1
shot accept
key Return
sleep 3
shot leftkeys
key Down Return
sleep 3
shot pad
key Home
sleep 1
key Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Left
sleep 1
key Return
sleep 2
shot menus
key Escape
sleep 1
shot escape
key Escape
sleep 3
shot leftpad
key Up Up Return
sleep 3
key Up Up Up Up Up Return
sleep 3
shot main
